\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 11th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Cactus is a \"wood\" found on the island of <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a> in the Oke Desert. It is green in color with a cactus like texture. The sanded wood is a whiteish light green color with no texture.\n</p><p>Sometimes, it could produce <a href=\"/wiki/Green_Cactus_Flower\" title=\"Green Cactus Flower\">Pink Flowers</a> that could be sold raw or processed into a <a href=\"/wiki/Jar\" title=\"Jar\">Jar</a> by the use of a <a href=\"/wiki/Dye_Machine\" title=\"Dye Machine\">Dye Machine</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cacti are one of the only \"trees\" that don't use the basic tree mesh for its appearance, just like its counterpart the <a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Cactus\" title=\"Purple Cactus\">Purple Cactus</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Cactus\" title=\"Red Cactus\">Red Cactus</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">bamboo</a>.</li>\n<li>Generally, cacti are not a tree.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Clos